# Tasks — TODO-feature-name

Implementation backlog for the design in `design.md`. Every task traces back
to one or more acceptance criteria in `requirements.md` (`AC-N`) and, where
relevant, to one or more component contracts under `contracts/<slug>.md`.

## Conventions

- Task IDs are stable: `T-<NN>` ordered by intended sequence.
- Status values: `todo`, `in-progress`, `blocked`, `done`.
- Each task names the AC(s) and contract(s) it advances. Tasks without a
  traceability target are rejected by the implementation agent.

